0..78 Comment "// A circuit rule in a `sign` block: a rule whose inputs are a rewrite and two"
79..158 Comment "// data wires, and whose body wires two nodes. `Sig` codes no circuit rule yet,"
159..236 Comment "// so the rule is kept beside the block\'s value rather than in it. The wiring"
237..305 Comment "// follows Lafont\'s interaction nets (_Interaction Nets_, POPL 1990,"
306..334 Comment "// doi:10.1145/96709.96718)."
